eeps one bounded brake — it can pause shelf minting for up to 7 days at a time, on the record, and it can never reach a deposit, a refund or a claim.Factory 0x9fE4…a6e0I accept the immutable pact: 0.005 tBNB launch fee, a genesis window that cannot close early, and a full refund to every depositor if I let the 7-day window to open trading expire — or, whatever I do, if the raise finishes too small to open a pool.Factory soft cap / wallet cap changed — the next deploy will use a fresh salt.Acknowledge the pact→ The rules on the right are immutable once this transaction lands. Tick the box to proceed.Deploy reserves your pool address before the wallet opens, so expect a moment before the prompt.CancelPreviewnot yet deployedT$TESTTest AgentxWindow24hPool addressground at deployThis is how your launch appears in the directory once it confirms./// DIALSLive factory dialsRead from the factory now — these move between launches.Launch fee0.005 tBNBPer-wallet cap500 TQUOTENetworkBNB Smart Chain Testnet"`;

